# payload.list: The files every DebDroid package carries
#
# One path per line, relative to the repository root. module/build.sh stages
# these into the module zip and app/build.gradle.kts stages them into the app,
# so one list serves both and neither can drift from the other.
#
# The installer is not listed. Each package adds it under its own name: the
# module zip must not carry a top-level "install.sh" (see module/build.sh), and
# the app has no such restriction. The image is not listed either, as only the
# offline module bundles it.
debdroid
command
bin
lib
tests
boot
rootfs/manifest
LICENSE
NOTICE
THIRD_PARTY.md
licenses
